00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.400
Boohoo. I'm not relevant as I used to be.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:57.720
Boohoo. My fans see me as this one thing when I wanna be another thing.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.780
