00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:14.260
Ain't nothing's gonna make this face give a shit.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:26.400
Alright fine. I'll do a diss track.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.580
It can't be that hard.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.660
Stop rapping.

